<view class="container"><view class="demo">本地演练版 · 不产生真实付款或安装权益</view>
<view class="title">确认安装包</view><view wx:if="{{order}}" class="card"><view class="heading">{{order.product.name}}</view><view class="price">¥{{order.price}}</view><view class="row">交付版本 {{order.product.version}}</view><view class="row">{{order.paymentText}}</view><view class="row">包含安装入口、教程、模型配置与问题自查。</view><view class="small">不含模型费用、人工技术服务或未明示的后续升级。领取期限、换机和退款条件仍待确认，真实购买暂未开放。</view></view>
<view class="card"><checkbox-group bindchange="agree"><label class="agreement"><checkbox value="accepted" checked="{{agreed}}"/><text>我已阅读服务范围，理解当前仅为模拟演练。</text></label></checkbox-group><button bindtap="terms">查看完整说明</button><button class="primary" disabled="{{!agreed || busy || !order || order.paymentStatus !== 'pending'}}" bindtap="pay">演练付款成功（不扣款）</button><button wx:if="{{order.paymentStatus === 'paid'}}" bindtap="result">查看演练交付结果</button><button disabled="{{busy || !order || order.paymentStatus !== 'pending'}}" bindtap="cancel">取消演练订单</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
</view>
